WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.240
At a great sacrifice, a father
gives away his old, worn-out cows.

2
00:00:05.290 --> 00:00:08.350
His son asks: to whom will you give me?

3
00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:12.040
In anger, the father answers: to Death.

4
00:00:12.090 --> 00:00:14.960
The boy waits three days at Death's house.

5
00:00:15.010 --> 00:00:19.050
Death offers him wealth, long
life and pleasures instead.

6
00:00:19.100 --> 00:00:21.020
The boy refuses them all.

7
00:00:21.070 --> 00:00:25.680
He wants one answer: what
happens to a person after death?

8
00:00:25.730 --> 00:00:28.870
So what does Death teach
him about the self?

9
00:00:28.920 --> 00:00:32.630
In this mission, you'll explore
the Katha Upanishad's chariot,

10
00:00:32.680 --> 00:00:35.440
with its driver, reins and horses.

11
00:00:35.490 --> 00:00:38.190
Then you'll watch salt vanish into water,

12
00:00:38.240 --> 00:00:41.300
and hear a teacher's
famous answer to his son.

13
00:00:41.350 --> 00:00:45.480
Your mission: find out what Death
teaches the boy about the self.
